# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NO STAFF DATA IN THIS REPO.
#
# Every input and output of these scripts carries personal data: names, UPNs,
# job titles, managers, device serial numbers, sign-in history, and offboarding
# notes. One export is materially worse than the rest - the passwordless
# "not yet enabled" group is a list of accounts without phishing-resistant
# authentication, which is a target list. None of it belongs in source control.
#
# The scripts read these from the working directory at runtime. Keep them beside
# the scripts on the workstation; do not commit them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Source exports
AzureAD-export*.csv
Staff-Roster*.xlsx
All?Devices*.csv
Passwordless*.csv
AD-Disabled-Accounts.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls

# Generated artefacts
AD-Updates.csv
AD-Name-Mapping-REVIEW.csv
AD-Exceptions.csv
AD-Stale-Accounts.csv
AD-Name-Corrections.csv
AD-Updates-PILOT-*.csv

# Run logs
NCStaffSync-*-changes.csv
NCStaffSync-*-issues.csv
AccountExpires-*.csv

# Staging directory used to move files to the workstation
_TRANSFER-TO-SERVER/

# Samples are hand-written with synthetic values and ARE tracked
!samples/*.SAMPLE.csv

.DS_Store
